#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:672
#, no-c-format
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:676
#, no-c-format
msgid "Who made this application?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:677
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The kdegames team. You can find their website <ulink url=\"http://games.kde."
"org\">here</ulink>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:680
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I start a new game?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:681
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&ktuberling; starts right into the 'game mode' by default. To restart the "
"game you may use <guibutton>New</guibutton> button on the toolbar. "
"Alternatively refer to <link linkend=\"game-new\">this</link> section of "
"'Interface Overview' for details."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:684
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I pause the game?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:685
#, no-c-format
msgid "This game does not have a 'Pause' feature as it does not require one."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:688
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the way this game looks. Can I?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:689
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes you can. Refer to <link linkend=\"theme_change\">this</link> section of "
"'Interface Overview' for details."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:692
#, no-c-format
msgid "I have made a mistake. Can I undo?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:693
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. To undo you can click <guibutton>Undo</guibutton> button on the "
"toolbar. Alternatively refer to <link linkend=\"edit-undo\">this</link> "
"section of 'Interface Overview' for details."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:696
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I use keyboard?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:697
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. This game can not be played using keyboard."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:700
#, no-c-format
msgid "I can't figure out what to do here! Are there hints?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:701
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. This game does not have a 'Hint' feature."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:704
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I have to quit the game now, but I'm not finished yet. Can I save my "
